+12.5 Durable run state
+`parley-deck/pipelines/<slug>/pipeline-run.json` is the durable cursor. It records:
+- `schema_version`
+- `pipeline_slug`
+- `status`
+- `current_block`
+- `completed_blocks[]`
+- `pending_gate`
+- `action_ledger[]`
+- `created_at`, `updated_at`
+- optional driver metadata
